      propertyPath: m_text
      value: "Mayor:\nHello Traveler! \nIt seems you've come to us in our time of
        need.. \nIf you would be so kind as to find 3 clues on where the\nmonster
        is it would help us.\nCome back to me when you find the clues..\nI hope my
